                <invention-title lang="de">VERZÖGERTE STEUERRÜCKKOPPLUNG IN EINEM ZEITDUPLEXTRÄGER UNTER VERWENDUNG GEMEINSAMER BURSTS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">RÉTROACTION DE COMMANDE RETARDÉE DANS UNE PORTEUSE DUPLEX À RÉPARTITION DANS LE TEMPS UTILISANT DES RAFALES COMMUNES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DELAYED CONTROL FEEDBACK IN A TIME DIVISION DUPLEX CARRIER UTILIZING COMMON BURSTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Methods and apparatuses for delayed control feedback utilizing common bursts in a time division duplex carrier is described. For example, the described aspects include an apparatus determining a configurable delay for an uplink ACK transmission to be transmitted by a subordinate entity utilizing a plurality of subframes, wherein the configurable delay corresponds to an integer number of subframes available for the subordinate entity to process a downlink data packet prior to transmitting the uplink ACK, and wherein the uplink ACK is associated with the downlink data packet, the apparatus transmitting to the subordinate entity a grant of resources of a first subframe of the plurality of subframes, the grant indicating the configurable delay, the apparatus transmitting the downlink data packet to the subordinate entity during the first subframe using the resources, and the apparatus receiving the uplink ACK from the subordinate entity during a second subframe of the plurality of subframes in accordance with the configurable delay.</p>
            </abstract>
